  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">You become an Expert in the skill affiliated with your drachensoul benefactor. You also gain a skill feat of your choice that you meet the requirements to, affiliated with that skill.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">When you benefit from Bond of Greed, during its duration you can apply the status bonus it grants to one skill check you make using the chosen benefactor’s skill for that spell’s duration.</span></p>"
